Under exchangeability and valid sampling-unit semantics, THM-XFER7 supplies marginal coverage.
THM-XFER8 prevents subgroup or conditional overstatement.
Bayesian claims
Bayesian statements are checked as consequences of their declared prior–likelihood model.
PRO-XFER6 prevents interpreting posterior concentration as target truth under model misspecification.
Robust-distributional claims
