THM-XFER18 propagates source and transfer errors.
THM-XFER19 gives target PCPE outer containment.
Exact mandatory channels remain separate.
Theory expansion
Assumption 12 and THM-XFER15 invalidate old target proofs when a new applicable mechanism enlarges the theory.
Modality discipline
THM-XFER21 blocks every generic invalid escalation.
Assurance
Every target release claim is accepted only through Prompt-11 derivation checking.
Therefore fleet evidence cannot bypass target proof obligations.
∎



