Option-count mismatch: many worthless options versus one valuable option.
Commitment preorder: verify reflexivity and transitivity.
Gross flexibility monotonicity: enlarge policy family and preserve value.
Negative net flexibility: enabling cost exceeds maximum benefit.
EVPI nonnegative: exhaustive finite calculation.
EVSI nonnegative: signal can be ignored.
EVSI bounded by EVPI: exact finite benchmark.
Information-refinement monotonicity: nested signals.
Decision-invariant zero EVSI: same action optimal in every signal cell.
Positive waiting: information arrives before deadline.
Negative waiting: option expires before signal.
Premature commitment: verify (m)-fold ratio.
Bellman recursion: compare with exhaustive policy enumeration.
Hidden contract state: same geometry, different future value.
Scenario-wise/nonanticipative: supplier reservation example.
Rectangular robust recursion: compare Bellman and exhaustive policy-law game.
Nonrectangular failure: recover value 1 versus 0.
Dynamic CVaR inconsistency: precommitment (R), future (S).
